{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17273","headline":"送许着作分司东都 · 权德舆","name":"送许着作分司东都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月旦继平舆，风流仕石渠。\n分曹向瀍洛，守职正图书。\n棣萼荣相映，琼枝色不如。\n宾朋争漉酒，徒御侍巾车。\n异日始离抱，维思烹鲤鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}